<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets variable repo, drain unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets variable repo, drain unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered 50 billion escudos in a variable rate repurchase pact and left its drain, or absorption rate unchanged at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be received by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
